.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-v2-customers-create - Create customer


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago v2 customers create [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates a new customer. An existing external_id returns 422 rather than updating that customer. Billing and payment settings are top-level fields, not a billing_configuration object. Relationships are omitted from the response unless retrieved later with a supported expansion.
Requires the product catalog to be enabled and customer write permission on the API key.


